1467
01:33:18,567 --> 01:33:20,267
♪ And this life ♪

1468
01:33:20,367 --> 01:33:23,337
<i>-Setelah musim tornado yang brutal</i>
<i>untuk wilayah Selatan,</i>

1469
01:33:23,437 --> 01:33:27,308
<i>badai menerjang di banyak</i>
<i>titik di Dallas Metroplex.</i>

1470
01:33:27,408 --> 01:33:30,611
<i>Di Highland Place Mall,</i>
<i>tornado mencapai puncaknya,</i>

1471
