1478
01:33:53,767 --> 01:33:56,237
-Bluebonnet, minuman Tutti Fruity buah naga Anda.

1479
01:33:56,337 --> 01:34:00,074
Untuk Chrysanthemum,
limun markisa.

1480
01:34:00,174 --> 01:34:03,310
Teh hitam karamel.

1481
01:34:03,410 --> 01:34:05,713
Oh, cake pop Anda.

1482
01:34:28,068 --> 01:34:29,538
-Terima kasih.

1483
01:34:29,638 --> 01:34:32,773
Aku sangat pemarah ketika aku tidak
